  "_comment": "Golden fixture set for JS-vs-PHP rerank/classifier/rule-engine parity testing (Phase 0-4 of the unified-search-engine plan). Each scenario is a sourceResults array matching the shape rerankSemanticCandidates() expects. Candidates deliberately carry simulated enrichment fields (rcr, nihPercentile, authorityAuthors, authorityJournal) so the citation-impact and authority code paths are actually exercised, not just the bare RRF core.",
